 34S 2cL g|G{-n}|G{-|g}/|G are all from 2018MuZY. Statistical factor            
 34S 3cL g=(2J+1)/[(2J{-n}+1)(2J{-T}+1)], where J is the resonance spin,        
 34S 4cL J{-n}=1/2 is the neutron spin, and J{-T}=3/2 is the {+33}S ground state
